🤖 My Nova – Personal AI Voice Assistant

My Nova is a personal AI voice assistant built using Python.

The goal is to create an intelligent assistant that can listen, understand, respond naturally, remember conversations, and perform tasks using AI and external tools.

✨ Planned Features

- 🎙️ Voice input and speech recognition
- 🧠 AI-powered conversations
- 🔊 Natural voice responses
- 💾 Conversation memory
- 🛠️ Task automation using tools
- 🔗 External API integrations

🛠️ Technologies

- Python
- Artificial Intelligence
- Speech Recognition
- Text-to-Speech
- APIs

🚀 Project Status

Currently in development.

🎯 Vision

To build a smart personal AI assistant that makes everyday digital tasks easier through natural voice interaction.

